                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a5bf0ff-0f84-3f39-ae39-aa15005b005a",
                        "entry_id": "4e77a704-23fa-3dba-9fab-0a44b7291219",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. последователь пуританизма, то есть религиозно-политического движения, появившегося в Англии в XVI веке и ставившего первоначально целью очищение англиканской церкви от остатков католицизма"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50c03643-48e1-459e-b214-5b5657931788",
                                "sense_id": "8a5bf0ff-0f84-3f39-ae39-aa15005b005a",
                                "text": "Сект было в Англии чрезвычайно много: главными были ― пуритане… пресвитериане шотландские, многочисленные индепенденты, допускавшие полную неограниченную свободу религиозных мнений, допускавшие, что община должна сама управлять своими религиозными делами, наконец, много сект, переселившихся сюда из Европы, например, анабаптистов и т. д."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b37bd764-6dd8-3cd4-9070-ecad7f08d364",
                        "entry_id": "4e77a704-23fa-3dba-9fab-0a44b7291219",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. сторонник чрезвычайно строгого образа жизни"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a68cf78-a5cf-4e14-b2a2-b31030cdd181",
                                "sense_id": "b37bd764-6dd8-3cd4-9070-ecad7f08d364",
                                "text": "Особенно он боялся помехи со стороны пуритан и пуританок, которые косо поглядывали не только на эмансипационные попытки Жорж Занд, но и на чувственные проявления любви вообще."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e7d1b6d-49d0-4416-b505-2f070f418a72",
                        "source_entry_id": "4e77a704-23fa-3dba-9fab-0a44b7291219",
                        "source_sense_description": "последователь пуританизма",
                        "target_lang_word": "Puritan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Puritan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0267e064-4fbb-3ef3-a863-b53780b32b6f",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b4e15f-b7fe-36ca-92cb-8784f641366b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a particular Protestant religious sect advocating greater purity and piety."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Puritan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b100cc14-266d-3824-902e-8931606d23ad",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e593e4-b943-3bb0-9510-4f47ccc160f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative letter-case form of puritan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3947160f-f704-40cd-b423-53115b8aa1e9",
                                                "sense_id": "b100cc14-266d-3824-902e-8931606d23ad",
                                                "text": "It’s a seedy time of the night and Jacky is telling me about sailors and their needs. A man called P. C. Alexander, an ex-Indian High-Commissioner in London has cleaned up Madras. There’s a very Puritan atmosphere here now, and the seamen are not happy. ‘All ship’s crew very happy with Calcutta. Can bring many girls there. Bombay too – no problem.’ Bombay is apparently the only city in India to license prostitutes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "086e5cdc-bfb1-404e-bb78-6829128a6bee",
                                                "sense_id": "b100cc14-266d-3824-902e-8931606d23ad",
                                                "text": "Chardonnay is very malleable, but once we get the fruit in we actually take a very Puritan approach to it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63de4c57-2fa0-4e9e-adcd-aa6c1c90bf8d",
                                                "sense_id": "b100cc14-266d-3824-902e-8931606d23ad",
                                                "text": "I learned to work from my grandfather, who held a very Puritan kind of work ethic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4c4768e-001b-4912-8c4a-36b94af58923",
                        "source_entry_id": "4e77a704-23fa-3dba-9fab-0a44b7291219",
                        "source_sense_description": "сторонник чрезвычайно строгого образа жизни",
                        "target_lang_word": "puritan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "puritan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ab9ca07-dc23-3fc1-b21a-c7ac643c40d9",
                                        "entry_id": "9bb5c26a-482c-324c-ae80-d50c3be88441",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A puritanical person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79684fdf-1f9f-4fb6-a923-b9cddda7a1da",
                                                "sense_id": "2ab9ca07-dc23-3fc1-b21a-c7ac643c40d9",
                                                "text": "These new puritans have turned out to be surprisingly unskilled and inexperienced - very different from my generation who invented wife-swapping, orgies and free love in the late Sixties and early Seventies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "puritan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4c584de-f16a-32fd-891f-2f8edbff2bc5",
                                        "entry_id": "96c8e09d-a797-3091-ac3c-5cb84eb15b97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acting or behaving according to the Puritan morals (e.g. propagating modesty), especially with regard to pleasure, nudity and sex; ascetic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
